<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1430_5111.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/><persName role="issuer" resp="#ner">Johann</persName> von Gottes gnaden <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erwoel=</unclear>
<lb n="2"/>ter und bestetter Bischoff zu <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-114" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Chur</placeName>.
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Unsern</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gruß</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ambt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">waß</unclear> wir liebs und guets
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermoegen</unclear> zuvor, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">L</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Besondere</unclear>.
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Waß</unclear> die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Herrn</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Einem</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eramben</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weisen</unclear>
<lb n="6"/><orgName role="recipient" resp="#ner">Rath alhie zu Chur</orgName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etlicher</unclear>, under <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsers</unclear> vor=
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fordern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Hn</unclear> Bischoffs <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Petri</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seeligen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vergleichen</unclear>
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stempffell</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">falsch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gemüntzter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pfennigen</unclear>
<lb n="9"/>wegen, so von einer benambten Personen
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">außgeben</unclear> worden, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eidt</unclear>: und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Bundtsgnoßisch</unclear>
<lb n="11"/>auß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründlich</unclear>: und nachparlich woll=
<lb n="12"/>mainung <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verstendiget</unclear>, haben wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deßen</unclear>
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">satten</unclear> bericht <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eingenommen</unclear>.
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Wan</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dan</unclear> unß an der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">treüe</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">pflichten</unclear>
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unsers</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">L</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">getreüen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Müntzmaisters</unclear> alhie
<lb n="16"/>gantz und gahr nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zweiffelt</unclear>, auch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">seithero</unclear>
<lb n="17"/>der müntz halben alle <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">redligkeit</unclear> an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ime</unclear>
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gespürt</unclear>, also, daß unß nichts möchte
<lb n="19"/>zu <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">einigem</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">argwohn</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verursachen</unclear>.
<lb n="20"/>So ist demnach <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unser</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gr</unclear> begehren und gesin=
<lb n="21"/>nen, daß die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Herrn</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">auß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">tragendem</unclear>
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ambt</unclear> guete inquisition und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nachfrag</unclear> ha=
<lb n="23"/>ben wöllen, von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wehn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dergleichen</unclear>
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">falsche</unclear> müntz und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pfennig</unclear>, (welche
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hochgedachts</unclear> unsers <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vorfahren</unclear> löblich
<lb n="26"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gedechtnuß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stempffell</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">durchauß</unclear> un=
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">förmig</unclear>,) in ansehen wir nichts anders
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1430_5112.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="28"/>dan allein den <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">leüten</unclear> ohne <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einicher</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eürer</unclear> ge=
