<lb n="33"/>Daran beschicht <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">was</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">an</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ime</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">selbst</unclear> billich,
<lb n="34"/>und der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">justiti</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gemaeß</unclear>, und wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sindt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">solches</unclear>
<lb n="35"/>umb die Herren, denen wir mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">g</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gueth</unclear>
<lb n="36"/>willen beij und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuogethan</unclear> verbleiben, an=
<lb n="37"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ders</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weegs</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuoerwidern</unclear> genaigt.,
